{"id": "192904641421", "postBody": "<div class=\"hs-embed-wrapper hs-fullwidth-embed\" data-service=\"youtube-nocookie\" data-responsive=\"true\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 0; min-width: 256px; display: block; margin: auto; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><div class=\"hs-embed-content-wrapper\"><div style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 56.25%; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 56.25%; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><iframe style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;\" title=\"YouTube video player\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" xml=\"lang\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/GE9U4Z0hrCw?si=BLRy3zUjv8cb2gCR\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen data-mce-src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/GE9U4Z0hrCw?si=BLRy3zUjv8cb2gCR\" data-mce-style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></div></div></div>\n<!--more-->\n<h3>About this webinar</h3>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Akka C</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\">EO </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/alan-kliki%C4%87-5945855/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\"></span></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tylerjewell/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Tyler Jewell</a></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/alan-kliki%C4%87-5945855/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\"></span></a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tylerjewell/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\">and Principal Solutions Architect&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/alan-kliki%C4%87-5945855/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Alan Klikić</a> explore what it takes to move from agent prototypes to fully operational agentic AI systems—faster and with greater enterprise confidence.</p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\">Learn how leading enterprises are building with confidence by using the right architecture, tools, and patterns to meet demanding SLAs and eliminate the risks of uncertainty. </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; letter-spacing: 0px;\">The Akka team also shares new innovations designed to help enterprises deliver agentic systems 3x faster, with 1/3 the compute, and lower token consumption.</span></p>\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ffce4a;\">Related items</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://45500578.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/45500578/collateral/webinars/presentations/Akka%20Webinar_%20Creating%20Certainty%20in%20the%20Age%20of%20Agentic%20AI%20-%20July%2017%202025.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-hs-domain-rewrite=\"true\">Webinar slides</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/aklikic/helloworld-agent\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Repo for the demo</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ffce4a;\">Additional resources</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/announcing-akkas-agentic-ai-release\" rel=\"noopener\">Blog: Announcing the Akka Agentic Platform</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/video-akka-overview\" rel=\"noopener\">Video: Overview of Akka Agentic Platform</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/blog/demo-build-and-deploy-a-multi-agent-system-with-akka\" rel=\"noopener\">Demo: Build and deploy a multi-agent system with Akka</a></li>\n</ul>", "templatePath": ""}